# Cross-system tracker

If you add or change a **world or vehicle visual**, update [`docs/TRACKER.md`](docs/TRACKER.md) in the **same change**.

For that row, fill Physics / Audio / VFX, or mark `n/a` with a reason.

- **Audio not n/a:** add or update tasks on the Vehicle Audio plan. Sample keys live in [`src/audio/config.ts`](src/audio/config.ts) (`tire.roll.mud`, `tire.roll.water`, `tire.roll.gravel`, `impact.water.*`, `scrape.rock`, forest/wind/river ambience).
- **Physics not n/a:** do not ship a new mesh without a collider, unless the row says visual-only (pebbles only).
- Do not mark a world feature complete while its tracker cells are empty.

```markdown
| mud ruts | terrain.ts splat | surface id 6 | tire.roll.mud | darker dust | n/a | in progress |
```
